    (hslo : 0 ≤ 1+(51/100:ℝ)-1/2-s)
    (hshi : 1+(51/100:ℝ)-1/2-s ≤ 2) :
    physicalExponent (51/100) d 1 q s-(boundary-11/16) ≤
