      (Finset.sum_nonneg (fun _ _=> sq_nonneg _)) (by simpa only [add_assoc] using he σ) hLhi using 1
    congr 1
    ring
  change (Real.sqrt Q)⁻¹/(2*Real.pi)*(∑σ : RayRing,Real.sqrt (∑z∈R,‖row σ z‖^2))≤_
