theorem source_batch_inverse_marked {Δ:ℝ}{D:RHZeroFreeExtension.AnalyticHigh.V2.HighData Δ}
    (S:RHZeroFreeExtension.AnalyticHigh.V2.SourceData D):
    ∃J:ℕ,∀η:Character,∃C:ℝ,0< C ∧ ∀ᶠZ:ℝ in atTop,
