theorem source_batch_inverse_fields {Δ:ℝ}{D:RHZeroFreeExtension.AnalyticHigh.V2.HighData Δ}
    (S:RHZeroFreeExtension.AnalyticHigh.V2.SourceData D)(counts:CountParameters M H D.t):
